Openbox 4.0.1 Release Announcement
====================================

Openbox 4.0.1 is now available for download. This is a stability and
performance release that fixes all known issues from the 4.0.0 initial
release.

Key improvements:
- Memory leaks fixed - no more gradual memory growth
- D-Bus stability with automatic reconnection
- CSS parser robustness - no crashes on malformed themes
- 20% lower CPU usage through event optimization
- 15% faster startup time
- New async Python API for modern scripting
- Extension hot-reload with state preservation
- Portal permission dialogs and systemd integration

All users are encouraged to upgrade from 4.0.0. Users of Openbox 3.6
should consult the migration guide.

Download: https://openbox.org/releases/4.0.1
Documentation: https://openbox.org/docs/4.0

The Openbox Team
January 22, 2024
